{
  "id": 483918503,
  "iid": 24864,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Lua Debugger: Remove re-entrant handling",
  "description": "Prevent PacketListRecord::dissect() when the Lua Debugger is\npaused. This will avoid the need for calling Lua functions which\nagain avoid the need for re-entrant handling. This is needed for\nLua dissector, post-dissector and filehandler.\n\nRevert dissect_lua and heur_dissect_lua early-return guard and\nthe re-entrant handling in FileHandler seek_read.\n\nPing #21193\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
